{"unit_id":"thissensen__dsh-harden#card-zh","repo":"thissensen/dsh-harden","commit":"b168aac887d1985a291f13e6a22a553cabfb11b0","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-harden 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的运行时扩展，在 agent 生命周期节点提供回合续接和错误恢复。它能处理被吞掉的工具失败、无正文收尾和可配置的网络重试，并提供上下文压缩、后台命令任务、子代理通知聚合及会话修复。用户可在设置面板调整相关选项，适合希望减少静默中断或管理长任务的 DSH 使用者。需要 DSH 0.2.2-rc.1 或更新版本；工具失败续接需配置警告前缀。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host/index.ts:83","src/host/index.ts:117","src/client/index.ts:316","src/host/guard.ts:45"]}
{"unit_id":"thissensen__dsh-harden#card-en","repo":"thissensen/dsh-harden","commit":"b168aac887d1985a291f13e6a22a553cabfb11b0","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-harden adds recovery features to the DSH web client. It retries selected network failures, prompts continuation after failed or empty turns, compacts context, runs background jobs, aggregates subagent notices, and repairs session logs. Requires DSH 0.2.2-rc.1 or newer.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host/index.ts:83","src/host/index.ts:117","src/client/index.ts:316","src/host/guard.ts:45"]}
