{"unit_id":"thissensen__dsh-harden#feature-1","repo":"thissensen/dsh-harden","commit":"b168aac887d1985a291f13e6a22a553cabfb11b0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-harden 的功能「失败回合续接」：检测被吞掉的工具失败或只有思考、没有答复的回合，并在结束前注入提示让模型继续。工具失败规则需在设置中填写警告前缀；无答复规则依据最后一步内容判断。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host/guard.ts:45","src/host/guard.ts:104","src/host/index.ts:190"]}
{"unit_id":"thissensen__dsh-harden#feature-2","repo":"thissensen/dsh-harden","commit":"b168aac887d1985a291f13e6a22a553cabfb11b0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-harden 的功能「网络失败补充重试」：平台的重试策略放弃后，可按配置的失败类型与次数立即补充请求重试，并记录重试事件供会话界面显示。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host/retry.ts:1","src/host/index.ts:117"]}
{"unit_id":"thissensen__dsh-harden#feature-3","repo":"thissensen/dsh-harden","commit":"b168aac887d1985a291f13e6a22a553cabfb11b0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-harden 的功能「上下文自动压缩」：会话上下文达到设置的阈值后，把较早的历史交给摘要流程压缩；可配置压缩范围、阈值和摘要指令。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host/compaction.ts:178","src/host/config.ts:58"]}
{"unit_id":"thissensen__dsh-harden#feature-4","repo":"thissensen/dsh-harden","commit":"b168aac887d1985a291f13e6a22a553cabfb11b0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-harden 的功能「后台命令任务」：启用后台任务工具后，模型可启动长命令，并通过 job_list、job_output 和 job_kill 管理任务及查看结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host/job-background.ts:422","src/host/job-background.ts:564"]}
{"unit_id":"thissensen__dsh-harden#feature-5","repo":"thissensen/dsh-harden","commit":"b168aac887d1985a291f13e6a22a553cabfb11b0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-harden 的功能「损坏会话修复」：设置页可扫描会话记录，对识别出的重试链或序号范围问题进行修正，并在校验通过后写回，让原本无法打开的历史恢复可读。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host/session-repair.ts:1"]}
{"unit_id":"thissensen__dsh-harden#caveat-1","repo":"thissensen/dsh-harden","commit":"b168aac887d1985a291f13e6a22a553cabfb11b0","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-harden 使用前须知：需要 DSH 0.2.2-rc.1 或更新版本；设置中的工具失败续接规则在未填写失败提示前缀时不会生效。（见 package.json:36、src/host/config.ts:24）","source":"generated","evidence":["package.json:36","src/host/config.ts:24"]}
